      "writtenOn": "2017-06-29T09:20:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This has not been inlined, as Morten suggested, because such a solution would have required an additional refactoring and a much more complex code once the SchedTune bits are going to be added by the following patches.\n\nI\u0027ve come up the first time with the energy_diff refactoring because I needed to compute more metrics (e.g. utilization and capacity variations) while walking the SDs. That\u0027s why a fundamental bit was the use eenv to carry on and compute multiple metrics in the same function.\n\nThe current version, at least to me, it\u0027s a sufficiently clean way to achieve these goals with still a reasonably readable code.",
